---
---
<section id="about">
    <div class="section-label">About me</div>
    <h2>Engineer &amp; <br/>Fintech Thinker</h2>

    <div class="about-grid reveal">
        <div class="about-text">
            <p>
                I'm a final-year Computer Science student at the <strong class="highlight">Faculty of Computer Science and Engineering (FINKI)</strong>, specializing in Application of Information Technologies. I enjoy designing scalable applications, solving complex technical problems, and continuously learning modern technologies.
            </p>
            <p>
                During my studies and personal projects, I have gained practical experience in developing <strong class="highlight">full-stack applications</strong>, <strong class="highlight">REST APIs</strong>, <strong class="highlight">relational databases</strong>, containerization, and deployment. I am currently looking for an internship or junior position where I can expand my knowledge while contributing to real-world software solutions.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="learning-container">
            <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Currently focused on</div>
            <div class="learning-grid">
                <div class="learning-item">
                    <div class="learning-dot"></div>
                    <div class="learning-text"><strong>Backend Development</strong><br/>Spring Boot, REST APIs, Django</div>
                </div>
                <div class="learning-item">
                    <div class="learning-dot secondary"></div>
                    <div class="learning-text"><strong>Database Engineering</strong><br/>PostgreSQL, SQL Optimization</div>
                </div>
                <div class="learning-item">
                    <div class="learning-dot tertiary"></div>
                    <div class="learning-text"><strong>Cloud & DevOps</strong><br/>Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD</div>
                </div>
                <div class="learning-item">
                    <div class="learning-dot quaternary"></div>
                    <div class="learning-text"><strong>Software Architecture</strong><br/>OOP, Design Patterns, Agile</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: start;
    }

    .about-text p {
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.85;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .highlight {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    .learning-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .learning-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
        gap: 16px;
    }

    .learning-item {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        background: var(--card);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .learning-dot {
        width: 8px; height: 8px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--accent);
        margin-top: 7px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent);
        animation: blink 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .learning-dot.secondary { background: var(--accent2); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent2); }
    .learning-dot.tertiary { background: var(--accent3); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent3); }
    .learning-dot.quaternary { background: var(--accent4); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent4); }

    @keyframes blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.3} }

    .learning-text { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    .learning-text strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 400; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>
